an style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2013. 01.</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
